Maintainer: Ron Shillings <ron.shillings@gmail.com>
Description: ribbon spreadsheet
 Folio Sheet is a spreadsheet with a ribbon interface, KeyTips, a File
 view, the standard desktop spreadsheet keyboard shortcuts and .xlsx as its
 native format, kept lossless: whatever it doesn't understand is saved
 back untouched.
 .
 Folio Sheet was called Folio Sheets before 0.19; the folio-sheets command still
 starts it.
